      "title": "July records $4.1 billion in PE/VC investments; exit value falls 83%",
      "link": "https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/july-records-4-1-billion-in-pe-vc-investments-exit-value-falls-83-126083101103_1.html",
      "description": "PE/VC investments rose 3 per cent YoY and 52 per cent sequentially to $4.1 billion in July, while exits fell 83 per cent YoY to $1.6 billion, IVCA-EY data shows",
      "source_name": "Business Standard Latest",
      "published": "2026-08-31T13:15:19"
